**Russia Helps African Countries Fight Terrorism: Russian Diplomat**

🇷🇺Russia is giving technical assistance to bolster the defence, law enforcement and justice capacities of its African partners, working with the UNODC, Director of the Russian Foreign Ministry’s Department for New Challenges and Threats Peter Ilyichev said at the International Collective Security Forum.
 
__Over the past five years, this assistance has benefited seven countries:__
 
🇦🇴 Angola;
🇨🇲 Cameroon;
🇬🇦 Gabon;
🇬🇶 Equatorial Guinea;
🇳🇬 Nigeria;
🇨🇬 Republic of the Congo;
🇸🇹 São Tomé and Príncipe.
 
👉 The program will be expanded to Mozambique, Mauritius, the Comoros, and the Seychelles.
 
🇷🇺 The Russian Navy is participating in maritime patrols, he also stated.
 
💰 Combating the financing of terrorism and money laundering is a priority for this cooperation, he added.
 
